# rasayan — src/hormonal.cyr: Rust 1.2.0's hormonal tests, ported
# Stdlib auto-included via cyrius.cyml
#
# The 25 unit tests of `hormonal.rs` and the 4 integration tests (tests/integration.rs) that call the hormones (the
# input and flux round trips, the long run, the stress-response chain with the transmitters), as they are written;
# tests/golden/hormonal.tsv checks every method, bridge, single tick and trajectory besides. Beyond them: both trace
# events and every codec's round trip.

